<title>FRANCE: CYCLING-DAUPHINE LIBERE SIXTH STAGE PLACINGS.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-DAUPHINE LIBERE SIXTH STAGE PLACINGS.</headline>
<dateline>BRIANCON, France 1997-06-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading placings in the</p>
<p>sixth stage of the Dauphine Libere cycling race over 187 km from</p>
<p>Digne-les-Bains on Saturday:</p>
<p> 1. Abraham Olano (Spain) Banestof five hours seven minutes 27</p>
<p>seconds</p>
<p> 2. Udo Bolts (Germany) Telekom		  one second behind</p>
<p> 3. Jean-Cyril Robin (France) US Postal	     five seconds</p>
<p> 4. Michael Boogerd (Netherlands) Rabobank			 9</p>
<p> 5. Manuel Beltran (Spain) Banesto				  57</p>
<p> 6. Miguel Angel Pena (Spain) Banesto		   one minute</p>
<p> 7. Santiago Blanco (Spain) Banesto			     1:37</p>
<p> 8. Mikel Zarrabeitia (Spain) Once				1:41</p>
<p> 9. Christophe Rinero (France) Cofidis			  2:20</p>
<p> 10. Francois Simon (France) Gan				  2:21</p>
<p>Overall standings:</p>
<p> 1. Olano			     26 hours 11 minutes 57 seconds</p>
<p> 2. Bolts			     one minute nine seconds behind</p>
<p> 3. Boogerd							     2:17</p>
<p> 4. Robin								 2:41</p>
